                "title": "Binance is working with banking giant BBVA to enable its customers to hold assets off-exchange: report",
                "text": "\n            <p>The move comes amid growing demand for enhanced security and efficient trading, with other crypto exchanges exploring similar solutions.</p>\n        ",
